cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "enteric-typer"
abstract: "A species-gated genotyping workflow for enteric pathogens (Escherichia coli, Salmonella enterica and Shigella). Given genome assemblies, it identifies the species, applies species-specific typing (MLST, serotype, AMR genes, plasmid replicons, virulence), builds a whole-genome SNP phylogeny and produces publication-ready summary figures."
